{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:LiftingAndDescent.CategoricalJetProlongation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"LiftingAndDescent.CategoricalJetProlongation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.CategoricalFoundations","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category"],"declarations":19,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.categorical_jet_prolongation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.categorical_jet_prolongation","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L77-L104","doc":"**Jet prolongation preserves the QU structure -- and the statement is\nvacuous, so this is now a theorem rather than an axiom.**\n\nIt stood as an `axiom` for\n\n    ∃ jet : JetPreservesQU C, jet.original = fh\n\nTaking `jet := fh` with `jetEval` and `unitSection` both the identity\ndischarges it: `eval_preserves_mul` closes by `tensor_id`, and the\nidentity is a monomorphism.  So the existential says only that the\ntrivial prolongation exists.\n\n`JetPreservesQU` has no field distinguishing `jet` from `original` --\nno first-order structure, no requirement that `jetEval` be a genuine\nevaluation rather than the identity, and `unitSection_mono` is\nsatisfied by the identity.  The prolongation content the proposition\ndescribes is therefore nowhere in the type, and adding it is a\nstructure refactor that is deliberately not guessed at here. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:categorical-jet-prolongation","label":"prop:categorical-jet-prolongation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetPreservesQU.unitSection_mono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetPreservesQU.unitSection_mono","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L75-L75","doc":"The unit section is a monomorphism. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetPreservesQU.unitSection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetPreservesQU.unitSection","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L73-L73","doc":"The unit section embeds A into J¹(A) as a subalgebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetPreservesQU.eval_preserves_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetPreservesQU.eval_preserves_mul","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L70-L70","doc":"The jet evaluation is compatible with multiplication:\nj¹ ∘ μ_jet = μ_A ∘ (j¹ ⊗ j¹).\nExpressed as: jetEval composed with the jet multiplication\nequals the original multiplication composed with jetEval on each factor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetPreservesQU.jetEval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetPreservesQU.jetEval","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L64-L64","doc":"The jet evaluation map. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetPreservesQU.jet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetPreservesQU.jet","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L62-L62","doc":"The jet Frobenius–Hopf object J¹(A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetPreservesQU.original","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetPreservesQU.original","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L60-L60","doc":"The original Frobenius–Hopf object. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetPreservesQU.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetPreservesQU.mk","kind":"ctor","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.JetPreservesQU","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.JetPreservesQU","kind":"structure","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L52-L75","doc":"**Jet prolongation preserves quantum universe structure**.\n\nJ¹(A) inherits multiplication, comultiplication, antipode, and\nFrobenius form from A, making it a Frobenius–Hopf object. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProlongedConnection.restriction_compatible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProlongedConnection.restriction_compatible","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L49-L49","doc":"The prolonged connection restricts to the original via jet evaluation:\n∇ ∘ j¹ = (j¹ ⊗ id) ∘ ∇'. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProlongedConnection.originalNabla","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProlongedConnection.originalNabla","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L45-L45","doc":"The original connection ∇ : A → A ⊗ Ω¹. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProlongedConnection.prolongedNabla","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProlongedConnection.prolongedNabla","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L43-L43","doc":"The prolonged connection ∇' : J¹(A) → J¹(A) ⊗ Ω¹. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProlongedConnection.jetEval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProlongedConnection.jetEval","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L41-L41","doc":"The jet evaluation map j¹ : J¹(A) → A. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProlongedConnection.jet_is_tensor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProlongedConnection.jet_is_tensor","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L39-L39","doc":"J¹(A) is the tensor product. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProlongedConnection.differentials","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProlongedConnection.differentials","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L37-L37","doc":"Kähler differentials Ω¹(A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProlongedConnection.jetObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProlongedConnection.jetObj","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L35-L35","doc":"The jet object J¹(A) = A ⊗ Ω¹(A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProlongedConnection.fh","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProlongedConnection.fh","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L33-L33","doc":"The original Frobenius–Hopf object A. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProlongedConnection.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProlongedConnection.mk","kind":"ctor","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L30-L30","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProlongedConnection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProlongedConnection","kind":"structure","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/categorical-jet-prolongation.lean#L27-L50","doc":"**Prolonged connection data**: the jet prolongation J¹(A)\ninherits a connection ∇' from the original connection ∇. ","signatureChunk":0}]}